","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":74,"sd":null},{"k":"15:75","t":"Indeed in that are signs for those who discern.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":75,"sd":null},{"k":"15:76","t":"And indeed, they [i.e., those cities] are [situated] on an established road.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":76,"sd":null},{"k":"15:77","t":"Indeed in that is a sign for the believers.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":77,"sd":null},{"k":"15:78","t":"And the companions of the thicket [i.e., the people of Madyan] were [also] wrongdoers,","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":78,"sd":null},{"k":"15:79","t":"So We took retribution from them, and indeed, both [cities] are on a clear highway.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":79,"sd":null},{"k":"15:80","t":"And certainly did the companions of al-Ḥijr [i.e., the Thamūd] deny the messengers.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":80,"sd":null},{"k":"15:81","t":"And We gave them Our signs, but from them they were turning away.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":81,"sd":null},{"k":"15:82","t":"And they used to carve from the mountains, houses, feeling secure.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":82,"sd":null},{"k":"15:83","t":"But the shriek seized them at early morning,","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":83,"sd":null},{"k":"15:84","t":"So nothing availed them [from] what they used to earn.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":84,"sd":null},{"k":"15:85","t":"And We have not created the heavens and earth and that between them except in truth. And indeed, the Hour is coming; so forgive with gracious forgiveness.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":85,"sd":null},{"k":"15:86","t":"Indeed, your Lord - He is the Knowing Creator.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":86,"sd":null},{"k":"15:87","t":"And We have certainly given you, [O Muḥammad], seven of the often repeated [verses] and the great Qur’ān.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":87,"sd":null},{"k":"15:88","t":"Do not extend your eyes toward that by which We have given enjoyment to [certain] categories of them [i.e., the disbelievers], and do not grieve over them. And lower your wing [i.e., show kindness] to the believers.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":88,"sd":null},{"k":"15:89","t":"And say, \"Indeed, I am the clear warner\" -","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":89,"sd":null},{"k":"15:90","t":"Just as We had revealed [scriptures] to the separators","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":90,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":27,"surahs":[15],"sajdah":false}